  "question": {
    "text": "Refer to the circuit diagram given in the figure. which of the following observations are correct?\nA. Total resistance of circuit is $6 \\Omega$\nB. Current in Ammeter is 1 A\nC. Potential across $A B$ is 4 Volts.\nD. Potential across CD is 4 Volts\nE. Total resistance of the circuit is $8 \\Omega$.\n\nChoose the correct answer from the options given below:\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/B_NrMfkxxosqTaVE7_gmT0JGEy5nZC3XdzT1S9fucsY.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "sXFQi",
      "text": "A, B and D Only",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
